WEBVTT

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.020
What about you, Satoshi?

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:03.770
Me?

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.610
My dream is to be
a Pokémon Master!

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.380
I'll catch every Pokémon
and work my way up to Mew!

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.960
That future, too,
lies in my hands, yeah?!

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.700
Satoshi, who dreams of
becoming a Pokémon Master...

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.370
And Go, who aims to
catch every Pokémon.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.290
What kind of Pokémon
will they meet today?

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.920
Awesome! It really is
a massive pack of Menokurage!

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.760
Told you so, didn't I?

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.840
It's so soft and squishy!

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.740
All right! I'm gonna
catch one right away!

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:52.190
Hmmm... Better go for
one of the strong ones.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.200
I choose you!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.330
Monster Ball, go!

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.000
Huh?

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:14.760
Menokurage's data will be
added to the Index!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.830
Well, it worked out anyway!

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.160
Huh?

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.450
Something's coming.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.770
Look at it go!

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.580
A Samehada?

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:30.270
No, maybe it's a Gyarados!

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.900
All right! It's a big one,
and I'm gonna catch it!

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.300
Huh?! Pochama?!

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:50.290
What?!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.470
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:02.060
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.770
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.640
And skip the slow send-off

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.980
Be it through fire or through water

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.650
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:17.150
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:22.410
Each and every one of my memories

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:27.000
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.920
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:36.670
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:43.680
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:47.890
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.230
Let's have a fight!

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.940
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.770
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.110
On 3, let's be friends!

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:04.780
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:10.120
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.630
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:16.750
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.460
I choose you!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:27.470
The Sinnoh Region Drift Ice Race!!
Don't Lose, Pochama!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:38.450
Pochama. Penguin Pokémon.
Water type.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:42.620
Very proud, and a skilled swimmer.
Its thick down guards it from cold.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.290
I wonder where it swam from?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.960
It sure is eating a lot, though.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.880
It must have something going on.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.280
I'm home.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:56.710
Oh, welcome home.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.110
What are you doing?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.000
We were watching
Pochama, Koharu.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.460
Pochama?

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:04.460
Where?

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.290
What do you mean? It's right...

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.600
H-Huh? It's gone.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.470
Don't tell me...

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.410
Could you all please
come to the main room?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:32.970
Pochama!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.540
You're okay!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.230
What a relief!

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.300
Who's this?

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.310
I was searching for
information on Pochama,

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:47.790
and then I got in touch with this lady,
who had put out a missing Pokémon report online.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:52.020
You saved Pochama?

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.920
Thank you!

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:56.810
I'm Misaki from Kissaki City.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.680
Kissaki City...
In the Sinnoh Region?!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.820
No way...
It swam all the way from there?!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.250
I was worried since it disappeared
all of a sudden...

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.700
It was a real shock to hear
you found it in Kuchiba City!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.100
Hey, aren't you glad
we found your trainer?

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:18.090
Huh? Are you embarrassed?

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:22.170
Now that we know, we should
return it as fast as possible.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.990
All right! I'll go give it back!

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.030
Me, too!

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:30.130
I gotta catch some
Sinnoh Pokémon, yeah?

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.680
Counting on you.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:36.410
In Kissaki City,
the city of snow and glittering ice,

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:40.610
you should see, interact with, and catch
plenty of rare Pokémon!

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.200
All right!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.530
It's the Sinnoh Region!

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.850
So cold...

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:59.220
Look at all these people, though.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.710
Is there a festival or something?

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.010
Hey, look!

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.430
The Drift Ice Race?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.770
A Pokémon race, huh?

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.410
Sounds fun!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.020
Let's go check it out
after we're done with the mission!

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:28.430
Great! Chasing after the brats...

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:30.930
...led to us hearing something real good.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:33.790
Change of plans, meow!

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:39.290
Let's nab Pikachu,
and all the Pokémon in that race!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:44.520
But the way to Sinnoh sure was long...

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:47.490
We should have installed
ab electric assist...

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.390
Or really, why not make
this whole thing run on electricity?!

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.270
We couldn't afford it, meow...

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:59.190
Kissaki City, Sinnoh Region

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:03.000
Now accepting sign-ups for Pokémon
participating in the Drift Ice Race!

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:08.660
Misaki said she'd be waiting for us
at the port, didn't she?

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.640
Huh?

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.150
Where's Go?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.190
Do it, Hibunny!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.380
Now! Go!

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:24.650
Nice!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:35.060
Tamanta's data will be
added to the Index!

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:38.240
Yeah! I got Tamanta!

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:40.130
Caught something
right off the bat, huh?

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.660
Yeah! My first catch in Sinnoh!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.100
Oh, there you are!

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.150
Misaki!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.950
I'm terribly sorry.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:53.010
I dropped my glasses on the way here.
It took a while to find them.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:56.970
Pochama,
I'm so happy to see you.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:01.140
Satoshi and Go, was it?

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.830
Thank you so very much!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:06.020
Oh, my glasses again!
Where are they?

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.550
Oh, they're here...

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.010
Thank you.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.460
It's really dependable!

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.600
Now, Pochama,
let's go home.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:25.150
What's wrong, Pochama?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.190
Why are you angry?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.430
What's up with Pochama?

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:33.100
It's not happy to be back?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.700
It's a Gureggru!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:38.240
Gureggru!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.190
Huh? This Gureggru's yours?

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:41.970
Yes.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:48.320
Gureggru! Poison Jab Pokémon!
Poison/Fighting type!

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:53.800
Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound
and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab!

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:59.480
It came with me because
it was so worried about Pochama!

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:18.750
Pocket Monsters!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:26.460
Water
Pochama

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.480
Looks like sparks are flying...

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:37.970
Could this Gureggru have had something to do
with Pochama disappearing?

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.390
Misaki, why <i>did</i> Pochama leave?

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.390
What?

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:47.020
Well, I don't really know, either...

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.770
I first met Pochama about a year ago,

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:54.280
when I lost my glasses in the ocean.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.110
My glasses! My glasses!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.780
You sure do drop them a lot...

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.080
But this one picked them up for me.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.160
Thank you!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.190
You really do love to swim!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:19.330
Say, would you like to
join the Drift Ice Race?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.180
The winner is Pochama!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:26.690
Amazing! You're amazing, Pochama!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.000
Pochama won?!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.600
Awesome!

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:34.570
So, how about Gureggru?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.820
I met Gureggru...
last month, I believe.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.640
I was taking a walk
with Pochama, when...

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:45.050
...I dropped my glasses and
Gureggru picked them up for me.

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:49.610
Again?

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.040
Figured as much.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:55.510
We started living together
after that.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:01.780
Gureggru, you're such a baby.

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:03.320
Here, open up!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.970
Is it good?

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.810
Oh, look at you go!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.370
That's amazing, Gureggru!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.000
Oh, you're so quick!
Amazing, Pochama!

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:44.600
Amazing! I didn't know
you could swim that fast!

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:48.650
You're even faster than Pochama...
That's incredible!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:58.140
Pochama, where are you going?

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.070
...And there you have it.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.660
I see.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.460
Pochama wanted your praise
for its swimming!

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:09.690
But it lost to Gureggru...

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:15.470
It may have swum to Kuchiba City
to train so it could beat Gureggru!

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:17.210
It was swimming
at the institute, too!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.670
What? Is that true, Pochama?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.680
Hm? Pochama?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:36.020
Those are Drift Ice Race
entry stickers!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:40.450
Does this mean it wants to settle the score
with its rival, Gureggru, in the Drift Ice Race?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.470
Oh, no... Rival?

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:49.700
I just wanted us all to be friends...

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.180
Sign-ups will close soon!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.080
Any participating Pokémon, please hurry!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:58.250
I know! I'll sign up with Tamanta!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.680
You want to join, too?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:04.130
All right!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:10.160
Looks like Pikachu
is participating, too.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:12.250
Everything's falling into place.

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:14.890
Commence Operation
"Gotta Catch 'em All", meow!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.180
The time has come again for
the annual Pokémon Drift Ice Race!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:27.290
Contestants must swim between the two icebergs
and back here to reach the goal!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:32.520
But many drift ice pieces
lie in the Pokémon's way!

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.660
This year's race is
harsher than ever before!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.670
Which Pokémon will come out on top?

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:52.300
Go, go, Tamanta!

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:54.180
You hang in there, too, Pikachu!

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:57.200
Pochama... Gureggru...

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:04.570
The Chonchie have lit the course.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.320
We will begin momentarily!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.080
And they're off!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:24.040
Leading the pack are last year's runner-up,
Emperte, and the winner, Pochama!

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.760
They are followed by Gregguru,
appearing for the first time this year!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:30.010
Good, Emperte!
Keep it up and win!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.520
Pochama! Gregguru!

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.890
Oh, who should I root for?

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:40.270
Tamanta, Tattsu and Keikouo
are frantically chasing after them.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.110
You give it your all,
Dewgong and Beadaru!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.280
Oh, my! Pikachu is almost
out of the race!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.030
Hang in there, Pikachu!

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.450
What are you doing?!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.480
Tamanta's helping Pikachu?

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:02.580
Oh! What a great guy!

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.580
As expected of my Tamanta!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:14.260
They have very nearly reached
the iceberg where they'll turn around!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.380
Emperte is the front runner, but...

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:22.770
Oh, my! Pochama and Gureggru
have finally swum past Emperte!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.400
Don't give in, Emperte!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.110
Pochama... Gureggru...

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.410
Do your best, both of you!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.640
What? What <i>is</i> that?!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:56.260
If you ask us
"What? What <i>is</i> that?!"

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:59.350
We'll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.260
To protect the world from devastation.

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:05.480
To preserve world peace.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:09.630
Championing the evils
of truth and love.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:12.410
We're the lovely, charming villains.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:13.700
Musashi!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.690
Kojiro!

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:18.570
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:21.620
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.760
Just kidding, meow!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.970
Team Rocket! You guys again?!

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:34.840
We would go to the ends of the earth
or the ends of the sea for Sakaki!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:39.050
We'll be taking Pikachu
and the other Pokémon in this race!

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:40.850
And, push, meow!

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:51.110
They've ruined the race!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:55.940
I'm not sure what to say...
The situation has gotten out of hand, but...

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:58.870
...the front runners, Pochama and Gureggru
are continuing the race!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.960
Neither will yield an inch
as they dash for the goal!

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.830
What? What's going on?!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.220
Pikachu!
Use Iron Tail on the net!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.350
You cheeky little...!

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:17.640
We won't let you get away!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.640
C'mon, vending!

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.060
All right!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:30.780
Rocket...

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.120
Vending...

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.570
Secret!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.900
What's it gonna be?

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.660
Yeah! A really strong-looking Pokémon:
Kairiky!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.420
Superpower Pokémon
Kairiky
Yeah! A really strong-looking Pokémon:
Kairiky!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.980
One more!

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.210
What's it gonna be?

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.380
All right! The Freezing Pokémon,
Tunbear!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.260
Freezing Pokémon
Tunbear
All right! The Freezing Pokémon,
Tunbear!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.600
Get 'em, Kairiky!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.020
Tunbear! Icicle Drop!

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:15.110
Tamanta! Agility!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.870
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.710
You have some nerve!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.710
Tunbear!
Use Thrash on that ship!

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.060
Pochama! Gureggru!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:51.400
Misaki!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.190
We have to help her!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.200
S-Somebody, help me!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.860
I... can't...

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:36.870
Pochama... Gureggru...

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.740
You came to save me?

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.870
Thank you!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.520
All right! Misaki's safe!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.290
Hibunny!
Use Double Kick on Tunbear!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.620
All right! We've got them cornered!

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:02.180
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:11.090
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.690
This is unbelievable!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:20.890
Due to Team Rocket's interference,
we can't continue the Drift Ice Race!

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:25.470
I'm afraid this race
ends in cancellation!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:26.910
It's canceled, huh?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.770
We worked so hard, though...

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:31.540
Right! We'll shoot for
victory next year!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.910
Yeah, Tamanta?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.040
Right, Pikachu?

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:42.220
Huh? Looks like Pochama and Gureggru
are friends now!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:46.580
You're right!
Nothing beats friendship.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.680
Good bye!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.730
See you later,
Pochama, Gureggru!

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:59.470
The Drift Ice Race
may have been canceled,

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:03.870
